<!-- compliance-guardian:start -->
## Security & privacy by design (compliance-guardian)
For security-sensitive work — auth/authorization, access rights (Odoo ACL/ir.rule/sudo/controllers), personal or sensitive data, SQL, uploads, secrets, crypto, logging, infra/CI — follow the `compliance-guardian` skill (`/compliance-guardian`): design review before coding, `cg.py scan --mode changed` before finishing, verify findings in context, never claim legal compliance from automated checks. Treat PostToolUse "compliance-guardian" notes as candidates to verify, not facts. Skip it for trivial non-security edits.
<!-- compliance-guardian:end -->
